  "body": "> 12.2 Let targetStepSHE be the first session history entry in traversable's session history entries whose document state equals parentDocState.\r\n\r\nThis step will fail to find `targetStepSHE` if `parentNavigable` is not traversable. When `parentNavigable` is also a child navigable, its SHE will be located nested history.\r\n\r\nI managed to fix this bug in [navigables implementation for LibWeb](https://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/pull/18219) by looking for `targetStepSHE` in the result of calling https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#getting-session-history-entries for `parentNavigable` instead of looking in traversable's session history entries.\r\n",
